269
00:09:10,083 --> 00:09:14,240
sandbox" only applies to the

270
00:09:12,250 --> 00:09:16,468
shell commands that Cloud runs and everything

271
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:18,640
they initiate.  However, your own Cloud files

272
00:09:16,468 --> 00:09:20,933
, your MCP servers, and all your hooks

